<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ET Cons March qtr pre-capex net falls.</title>
<headline>ET Cons March qtr pre-capex net falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gold profits	     2.00		  vs 3.82</p>
<p>    Capital spending	 2.5		   vs 3.68</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)	 621		   vs 617</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled	    88,670		vs 84,798</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)	   7.01		  vs 7.28</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)	   51,888		vs 50,221</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	55,111		vs 56,170</p>
<p>Full name: Eastern Transvaal Consolidated Mines Ltd, part of Avgold Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
